  "zh": "# APEC 深圳峰会主导外交，AI 超算突破，金价贸易波动，医疗民生受关注\n## 国际外交\n- **APEC 中国年**：深圳主场外交秀，彰显中国在亚太合规与合作的领航地位。\n- **特朗普访深圳**：现任美总统首访深圳，释放中美高层互动新信号。\n## 科技AI\n- **中国超算夺冠**：国产超算再登顶，算力自主可控再获硬核证明。\n- **OpenAI 解散机器人团队**：OpenAI 收缩机器人业务，聚焦大模型商业化路径。\n## 经济市场\n- **金价跌破千元**：黄金回落破千元关口，避险情绪降温引发投资重估。\n- **10月进出口增长31%**：外贸强劲反弹，显示外需复苏与供应链韧性。\n## 社会民生\n- **瘫痪博主 AI 托管7天**：瘫痪博主让 AI 全权管理生活，探索辅助技术边界。\n- **多地医院 关闭急诊**：多地急诊缩编引发就医焦虑，公共卫生资源分配待解。",
  "en": "# APEC Shenzhen summit drives diplomacy; AI and supercomputing breakthroughs; gold and trade swing; healthcare concerns rise.\n## Intl Diplomacy\n- **APEC China Year**: Shenzhen hosts a diplomatic showcase, underscoring China's leadership in Asia‑Pacific cooperation.\n- **Trump Visits Shenzhen**: The sitting U.S. president makes his first trip to Shenzhen, signaling a new high‑level engagement.\n## Tech & AI\n- **China Supercomputer Tops World**: Domestic supercomputer reclaims the top spot, proving self‑reliant computing power.\n- **OpenAI Disbands Robotics Team**: OpenAI winds down its robotics unit to focus on large‑model commercialization.\n## Economy & Market\n- **Gold Price Falls Below 1000 Yuan**: Gold drops under the 1,000 yuan/gram threshold as safe‑haven demand eases.\n- **October Trade Surges 31 Percent**: Exports and imports jump 31%, reflecting resilient global demand and supply chains.\n## Society & Livelihood\n- **Paralyzed Blogger Hands Life to AI**: A paralyzed blogger lets AI manage daily life for a week, testing assistive tech limits.\n- **Hospitals Close Emergency Departments**: Multiple hospitals shutter ERs, raising public anxiety over medical access."
